<title>SWITZERLAND: US consultants Arthur D.Little venture into Geneva.</title>
<headline>US consultants Arthur D.Little venture into Geneva.</headline>
<dateline>GENEVA 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. management consultant firm Arthur D.Little is opening up in Geneva where it has taken over a Swiss information systems company, Swiss news agency ATS quoted a company official as saying.</p>
<p>The agency quoted Philippe Planchat as saying that Arthur D.Little hoped to concentrate on the financial information technology market in French-speaking Switzerland following the acquisition of Compagnie de Service et de Conseil (CSC).</p>
<p>--- Reuters Geneva Newsroom 41-22-733 38 31</p>
